        "comments": "The assembly csSphRuss3.1 is based on 166x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This is an allodiploid species and the assembly reflects this genomic complexity (a copy of each chromosome from both parental genomes). The micro chromosomes are collapsed and ma not be correctly represented in full.",
